150	// The address columns' minimum widths, from what the notation can hold:
151	// 255.255.255.255/32 is 18 characters, and a full IPv6 with its prefix length
152	// is 43. The IPv6 minimum is deliberately short of that — a column wide enough
153	// for the worst case would take half an 80-column terminal to serve the rare
